  "npcs": [
    {
      "uid": "npc_0001",
      "type_id": "kabir",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 6,
      "facing": "down",
      "interactable": true,
      "dialog": {
        "chains": [
          {
            "chain_id": "sem3",
            "lines": [
              "What?Look I'm just WAiting for my next class.",
              "This place is somewhat free from the outside chaos.",
              "Silence is very underrated."
            ],
            "emotion": "serious"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "sem4",
            "lines": [
              "You again.",
              "Group project assigned today. Worst part of university tbh.",
              "I'd rather do four people's wprk alone than manage them.",
              "Reliance on others is just delayed disappointment."
            ],
            "emotion": "serious"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_5",
            "lines": [
              "...",
              "My lab partner quit halfway through.Left me with the project",
              "Expected as much. I shouldn't have kept my hopes up."
            ],
            "emotion": "serious"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_6",
            "lines": [
              "Still around huh?",
              "You don't try to make small talk.I appreciate that.",
              "Most people just chatter to fill in the silence.",
              "Noise is just cheap comfort according to me."
            ],
            "emotion": "serious"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_7",
            "lines": [
              "Hey.",
              "Got stuck on an assignment for three whole days.",
              "Someone from class dropped off their reference notes.",
              "Annoying when people ruin your bad mood by being decent."
            ],
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_8",
            "lines": [
              "Hey wanna sit together?",
              "Joined that group project again.",
              "Didn't take over the whole thing this time.",
              "Let them handle their parts."
            ],
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_9",
            "lines": [
              "Hey. Did a group study session today.",
              "A few people actually sat with me.",
              "Didn't hate it as much as I thought I would.",
              "Islation is easy but it gets boring after a while."
            ],
            "emotion": "happy"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_10",
            "lines": [
              "Morning.",
              "Someone asked me about course selection today.",
              "I spent 15 minutes mapping it out for them.",
              "It...wasn't that bad."
            ],
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_11",
            "lines": [
              "Senior year moves really fast, doesn't it?",
              "My group finished our final capstone early.",
              "We're acually going out for food later.",
              "See you later."
            ],
            "emotion": "happy"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_12",
            "lines": [
              "Last days.",
              "Thanks for sticking around",
              "Don't let the noise change you."
            ],
            "emotion": "happy"
          }
        ],
        "on_complete": "loop_last"
      }
    },
    {
      "uid": "npc_0002",
      "type_id": "rafi",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 6,
      "facing": "down",
      "interactable": true,
      "dialog": {
        "chains": [
          {
            "chain_id": "s1",
            "lines": [
              "Hey there. First week.I hope this journey becomes memorable.",
              "I'm Rafi and  I was just color-coding the term syllabus.",
              "If you plan from day one, nothing can surprise you."
            ],
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "s2",
            "lines": [
              "Lab reports are due.",
              "I spent four hours double checking my calculations yesterday",
              "Found zero errors. That's how it should be."
            ],
            "emotion": "serious"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "s3",
            "lines": [
              "Morning.",
              "The professors are grading much harder this term.",
              "I lost two marks on formatting error. Two marks.",
              "A small mistake is just a larger one in disguise."
            ],
            "emotion": "serious"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_4",
            "lines": [
              "...FAiled my first pop quiz.",
              "I kept re-reading the first question thinking it was a trick",
              "Ran out of time.",
              "Turns out overthinking charges the same as guessing."
            ],
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_5",
            "lines": [
              "Don't ask about the midterm.",
              "Spent 48 hours reviewing past papers.",
              "Blanked out completely on section two.",
              "Brain has a funny way of locking itself in dire times."
            ],
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_6",
            "lines": [
              "Hey.",
              "I threw out my color-coded planners yesterday.",
              "I was spending more time planning my schedule than living it",
              "Planning for a storm doesn't stop the rain I guess."
            ],
            "emotion": "serious"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_7",
            "lines": [
              "Remember my notebook where I wrote every mistake I  made?",
              "I stopped writing anything in it.",
              "Now I just write down what I learned instead.",
              "Some bugs disappear in 5 minutes. Some stay for years."
            ],
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_8",
            "lines": [
              "Morning again.",
              "Group project went completely off the rails yesterday.",
              "A year ago, I'd have panicked.",
              "Today I ust rewrote the code in 20 minutes."
            ],
            "emotion": "serious"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_9",
            "lines": [
              "Hey there. How's it going?",
              "A freshman asked me how to handle failing a test today.",
              "I told him to eat something,get some sleep and try again.",
              "Some new experiences really do shape you huh?"
            ],
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_10",
            "lines": [
              "Senior year thesis is brutal man.",
              "Half of my code broke during demonstration.",
              "I just laughed and debugged it live infront of the board.",
              "Perfection is boring anyways."
            ],
            "emotion": "happy"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_11",
            "lines": [
              "We're almost at the finish line aren't we?",
              "Looked back at my semester 1 notes. I was so rigid back then",
              "Glad I let some of the edges wear off.",
              "You can't build something flexible if you're afraid to bend."
            ],
            "emotion": "happy"
          },
          {
            "chain_id": "chain_12",
            "lines": [
              "Finally at the finish line.",
              "thanks for letting me obsess over details for four years.",
              "I still make mistakes every week.",
              "Difference is, I don't apologize to the notebook anymore."
            ],
            "emotion": "happy"
          }
        ],
        "on_complete": "loop_last"
      }
    }
  ],
